@title Drill Dozer (USA)
@file Drill Dozer (U).gba
@game V49E
@chip SRAM
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@save skip: nothing is written through the file menu or the opening; the first save is the stage-clear save after stage 1 (the Skullker hideout and its boss), longer than this session got: the route here reaches the second gear (shift-up tutorial passed) in the hideout
# File 1 New Game, the opening, the lobby floor gives way; underground:
# drill tutorial (hold R), jump-drill through the grey rubble, the bolted
# purple blocks and the gold blocks into the hideout, up the platforms,
# through the purple column into the gear room; gear 2 and its shift-up
# tutorial (R, then R again at SHIFT UP).
# nba's camera trails by a few pixels in vertical scrolls (f4032, f4182,
# f15491) and its sprite animation frames differ; the drill-dust particles
# land differently on mgba (f11467, f11731, f15926: dingbat-bios = nba).

